        "text": "(hB : IsCompact B) (m : ℕ) : ∃ C, 0 < C ∧ ∀ z ∈ B, z.1 < 1 → (cartesianChart h z).1 ≤ 1 → (cartesianChart h z).2.1 ∈ Icc lo hi → (cartesianChart h z).2 ∈ K → ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m (fun y => ∑ i, cartesianMonomial h (b i) (f i) y) z‖ ≤ C * (cartesianChart h z).1 ^ (bmin - m)  -- set form, all q ≤ 1, no filter"
